# Rename to CODEOWNERS when a second person joins.
# The last matching pattern wins. Replace the handles with real ones.

# Project owner: rules, core, tools, CI
*                       @project-owner
/core/                  @project-owner
/AGENTS.md              @project-owner
/living-spec.json       @project-owner
/tools/                 @project-owner
/.github/               @project-owner
/docs/workflow/         @project-owner
/docs/prompts/          @project-owner

